          "url": "https://github.com/Md-Ashraful-Pramanik/MapCoder/blob/c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007/README.md#L22-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_240ebff84dcb12a5b8c4050843434c9b5a51703cdd22d6ff36dbaaf723de3dfa",
        "slc_7e6a4c128828be539d56af8b594f74023e4a18a651bb315f252491957c226a91"
      ],
      "text": "MapCoder uses four LLM agents mirroring the human programming cycle: retrieval, planning, code generation, and debugging."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_dfcc1581b76db3195dc0ae2686f8f7cbd82de3e7cd383edb9faabec05e0005f7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007",
          "git_sha": "543753d2a7ae464d4795bcad3911df413162e225",
          "line_end": 31,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "md-ashraful-pramanik/mapcoder",
          "url": "https://github.com/Md-Ashraful-Pramanik/MapCoder/blob/c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007/README.md#L31-L31"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5137c52f8f71deb737982d541a49c359abda263ba8ec366529a1fbe9da17697d"
      ],
      "text": "The retrieval agent generates k user-defined similar problems using the LLM itself, without manual crafting or external retrieval models."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c627d387a63a52867a02a44c4075f93d34f10b7af632d43a8b8d1594783151ae",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007",
          "git_sha": "543753d2a7ae464d4795bcad3911df413162e225",
          "line_end": 28,
          "line_start": 27,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "md-ashraful-pramanik/mapcoder",
          "url": "https://github.com/Md-Ashraful-Pramanik/MapCoder/blob/c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007/README.md#L27-L28"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_240ebff84dcb12a5b8c4050843434c9b5a51703cdd22d6ff36dbaaf723de3dfa"
      ],
      "text": "MapCoder features an adaptive agent traversal schema that dynamically routes among agents, e.g. iteratively fixing bugs, rather than a fixed pipeline."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2a37229610a9c1c2f8a435551b8748ef0ace7f16091e4786c83f6f1cd2a4bfd2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007",
          "git_sha": "543753d2a7ae464d4795bcad3911df413162e225",
          "line_end": 35,
          "line_start": 35,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "md-ashraful-pramanik/mapcoder",
          "url": "https://github.com/Md-Ashraful-Pramanik/MapCoder/blob/c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007/README.md#L35-L35"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4c9f8f3291ab6db3191b45ebae00d2534a72d2a7560c236d9804e2f97c1c8d40"
      ],
      "text": "The coding agent turns a plan into code, tests it on sample I/O, hands failures to the debugging agent, and otherwise predicts it as the final solution."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_371fa80e9df7d9688d4d16b159bb446cd67e5b3098ff6523d1907dfbcf6791bf",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007",
          "git_sha": "543753d2a7ae464d4795bcad3911df413162e225",
          "line_end": 37,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "md-ashraful-pramanik/mapcoder",
          "url": "https://github.com/Md-Ashraful-Pramanik/MapCoder/blob/c87e6d914d196e12fa2b144882122459a4b98007/README.md#L37-L37"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_77290d753687dc490d22f8a3ec71fd2d0df1b9ce41ee1497e30794c93c0e320f"
      ],
      "text": "The debugging agent is supplemented with plans from the planning agent, analogous to humans cross-checking their plan while fixing bugs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6e57b8870ee84ed513f5c2ef1d953f2b15e2f7aa7676beeb4c8fa29b00eb85f4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
