        "slc_7e6a4c128828be539d56af8b594f74023e4a18a651bb315f252491957c226a91"
      ],
      "text": "Reported pass@1 results include HumanEval 93.9%, MBPP 83.1%, APPS 22.0%, CodeContests 28.5%, and xCodeEval 45.3%."
    },
    {
