        "slc_720f0e84549fff71ac4961f12c6bc5c9c1bf46b424d02955fc641518e8788c49"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI entry point is src/main.py with options such as --model, --dataset, and --strategy (e.g. ChatGPT, HumanEval, MapCoder)."
    },
    {
